      <section id="about-2" class="Index-page"  data-collection-id="5c23fb4b4d7a9c545b120f2b" data-parallax-id="5c23fb4b4d7a9c545b120f2b" data-edit-main-image="Background">
        
        <div class="Index-page-content ">
          <div class="sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12" data-type="page" data-updated-on="1790477134570" id="page-5c23fb4b4d7a9c545b120f2b"><div class="row sqs-row"><div class="col sqs-col-12 span-12"><div class="row sqs-row"><div class="col sqs-col-1 span-1"><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/a4984dfa-0c47-446e-905d-be1fd5f4a2ef_1389/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/a4984dfa-0c47-446e-905d-be1fd5f4a2ef_1389/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.spacer" data-website-component-id="yui_3_17_2_1_1545862936551_4978" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1545862936551_4978"><div class="sqs-block-content">&nbsp;</div></div></div><div class="col sqs-col-10 span-10"><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" data-sqsp-block="text" id="block-yui_3_17_2_4_1444756733940_17682"><div class="sqs-block-content">

<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>
  <p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The Hutchinson Clinic is a multi-specialty medical clinic covering all of your primary and specialty care needs. With over 90 doctors and providers and over 30 clinical departments, the Hutchinson Clinic has you covered.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Caring for you everyday...in every way.   For a list of physicians and departments, click <a href="/s/hc-14-Jan-2020.jpg" target="_blank">here</a>, or choose from the dropdown lists to quickly navigate to a physician’s page or a specific specialty.</p>
</div>




















  
  



</div></div><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-code code-block" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.code/1ab0d177-c24d-4379-bf40-94c2e83b446f_1111/website.components.code.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.code/1ab0d177-c24d-4379-bf40-94c2e83b446f_1111/website.components.code.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.code" data-sqsp-block="code" data-website-component-id="yui_3_17_2_1_1549433577509_7606" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1549433577509_7606"><div class="sqs-block-content"><div
